### How does it work architecturally?  
Each application—Risk, Audit, Issue Management—runs its own specialized AI agent trained on domain-specific workflows, policies, and data.  
The **federated orchestration layer**, powered by LangGraph, coordinates these agents:  
- It breaks down complex queries into sub-tasks  
- Queries multiple agents to aggregate multi-domain insights  
- Enforces unified governance while respecting local data policies  
- Provides an AI fabric that is adaptive, fault-tolerant, and explainable
 

